From 6e88e8689df7af1e0d560111384d432006659bfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stella Reine <stella@styna.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:03:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] win32u: Report GPU statistics and performance data from
 host telemetry.

NtGdiDdDDIQueryStatistics now reports adapter, node (3D engine running
time) and segment (dedicated memory use) statistics, and
NtGdiDdDDIQueryAdapterInfo supports KMTQAITYPE_ADAPTERPERFDATA
(temperature, memory clock, power, fan).

Data comes from NVML for NVIDIA GPUs, matched by Vulkan device UUID, or
from amdgpu-style sysfs and hwmon files. Running time is integrated from
the sampled utilization.
---
